Subject: [PATCH 009/230] Referral mechanics: invite codes, one-shot
 redemption, capped global bonuses
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Each account gets one reusable code (unambiguous alphabet); an account may
redeem exactly one other code, ever, and a code's owner can never redeem it
themselves. The referrer earns +10 per paid invite on the global board only,
capped at 25 paid invites — later connections still record with rewarded=0.
Points flow through the ledger (source=referral_bonus) so idempotency and
the tiebreak are inherited. Profile gains an Invite friends card with the
copyable code, honest paid/cap stats and the redeem form; rules documented
in scoring-rules.md and pinned by tests/referral.test.ts.

